## Build output
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## IDE
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

## Test output
TestResults/
coverage*/
# ...but not source folders (git matches case-insensitively on Windows).
!src/**/Coverage/
*.trx

## BlazorTestPlatform (__baselines__ and __snapshots__/baselines.json ARE committed; run output goes to TestResults/btp)
.btp/
# Only the Linux visual baselines are committed: CI gates on them, and scripts/visual-tests.sh renders the same ones.
# Windows and macOS baselines are written by local runs (BTP_UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=missing) and stay on that machine.
**/__snapshots__/**/*.png
!**/__snapshots__/**/*-linux.png
!**/__snapshots__/**/*-linux.*.png
